{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1346863-what-would-happen-if-a-solar-exalted-fell-in-love-with-an-abyssal","id":1346863,"title":"What would happen if a Solar Exalted fell in love with an Abyssal?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-11-07T15:01:47-08:00","id":1346863,"title":"What would happen if a Solar Exalted fell in love with an Abyssal?","content":"What would the repercussions be? And how would the Solar\u2019s predestined Lunar mate feel about it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-07T15:22:09-08:00","id":1346870,"title":"","content":"Repercussion? They have to manage a relationship around a death curse and the deathknight's Liege, which varies in difficulty by edition. 2e will probably make it the most difficult because of how extra-dickish Resonance became between 1e and 2e. As for the Lunar mate, assuming the Solar even has one (a given in exactly one edition out of three), that's wide open. It need not be dejection; the Lunar might not actually care very strongly, or on the flipside, might start to wonder about a threesome.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-07T15:37:10-08:00","id":1346877,"title":"","content":"Depends on a bazillion factors. <br /> What does the Abyssal think of the Solar? What does the Solar think of Abyssals? What does the Abyssal think of Solars? What do the Solar's friends think of the Abyssal? What do the Abyssal's friends think of the Solar? Of Abyssals/Solars in general? What do their friends think of each other? What Tie does the Lunar have to the Solar? What does the Solar think about the Lunar? What about the Abyssal's Lunar mate (or do they even have one)? So on and so forth. <br /> <br /> Really, all you've said is &quot;A loves B. B has implied ties to D. D is implied to be EVIL. C has unspecified feelings about A. They all have superpowers.&quot; <br /> <br /> Is this Moray Darktide falling for one of the Silver Prince's followers? Courtly romance! <br /> Is this Zenith Hatesdark falling for Midnight Hateslight? Social actions! <br /> Is this Nighty Infiltratorpants falling for Dusky Loyalson? Intrigue! <br /> Is this Dawn Von Murderfight falling for Dayton Runningaway? Action and adventure!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25764-vwllss-trnt-prncss","name":"vwllss trnt prncss","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"244"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-07T15:37:52-08:00","id":1346878,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1346863-what-would-happen-if-a-solar-exalted-fell-in-love-with-an-abyssal?p=1346870#post1346870\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> As for the Lunar mate, assuming the Solar even has one (a given in exactly one edition out of three), that's wide open. It need not be dejection; the Lunar might not actually care very strongly, or on the flipside, might start to wonder about a threesome.</div> </div> </div> </div>And note that, even in 2e, the only edition where a Solar was absolutely guaranteed to have a Lunar mate, the relationship that entails needn't be a sexual or romantic one. A heterosexual female Solar could have a heterosexual female Lunar as her bondmate, and be platonic battle-sisters (or, heck, <i>literal</i> sisters - Exalted likes dramatic cliches like that well enough), and still fall romantically for an Abyssal who's a heterosexual guy. Relationships don't need to be romantic to be intense or the source of good stories, and even 2e, the edition that put the most weight on the Solar-Lunar bond, never denied that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-07T19:01:18-08:00","id":1346914,"title":"","content":"Thanks. These are all really good ideas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-07T19:52:48-08:00","id":1346925,"title":"","content":"This is actually the state for my character. We have an NPC abyssal one our party who started off as a one-note antagonist, but instead of killing her we found a way for her to stick around. My Zenith is basically a classic paragon, doing good because it\u2019s worth doing, etc, and that resonated with the Abyssal (she had a tragic backstory about the silver prince). Two story-arcs later, they had an epic and beautiful kiss in Champoor, and have been working things out since. The Abyssal is trying to start over as a new person, but she\u2019s uncomfortable with how much underworld baggage she has to carry, and worries that she might just be a monster pretending to be a person. My Zenith is helping with meditation and encouragement, our Night Caste is teaching her medicine so she can heal as well as hurt (being a one-note tournament character, the abyssal was the most combat-focused member of our team) and it\u2019s an ongoing theme.<br /> <br /> Currently, my Zenith\u2019s goal is to learn how to free souls from Soulsteel so she can rescue the Abyssal\u2019s family\u2019s souls from the weapon the silver prince forced her to carry.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24172-sticks","name":"Sticks","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24172_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-07T22:31:21-08:00","id":1346944,"title":"","content":"@awesome!!! Are both characters female or is the Zenith male?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-07T22:32:00-08:00","id":1346945,"title":"","content":"I meant <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24172-sticks\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24172_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24172\" data-vbnamecard=\"24172\">Sticks</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-08T06:02:02-08:00","id":1346993,"title":"","content":"Most likely Tragedy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9124-satoshi","name":"satoshi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"282"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-08T06:42:08-08:00","id":1346999,"title":"","content":"@Penelope<br /> <br /> Both are female. My Zenith is a former Immaculate monk who\u2019s been questioning her identity ever since she exalted. She\u2019s been holding to her vows until she feels it\u2019s the right time to break them, so chastity went out the window only when she realized that she really did love the abyssal.<br /> <br /> It\u2019s been a bit of a roller-coaster because the Neverborn are still whispering in the Abyssal\u2019s ear, and she\u2019s struggling with her own identity (am I just a weapon pretending to be a person?) but it\u2019s a work in progress.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24172-sticks","name":"Sticks","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24172_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-08T07:03:38-08:00","id":1347009,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24172-sticks\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24172_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24172\" data-vbnamecard=\"24172\">Sticks</a> I love it! That's so romantic.<br /> <br /> Are Immaculate Order monks not supposed to have sex?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-08T07:25:37-08:00","id":1347014,"title":"","content":"Brokeback Mountain.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-08T07:26:00-08:00","id":1347015,"title":"","content":"They do take a vow of celibacy. No marriage, no sex. (Masturbation is allowed)<br /> <br /> If they break the vow, they (in theory) get kicked out of the order.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-08T08:48:53-08:00","id":1347036,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2402_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2402\" data-vbnamecard=\"2402\">The Wizard of Oz</a> too bad sexting doesn\u2019t exist in Exalted...<br /> <br /> Are the Sidereals the ones behind the Immaculate Order?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-08T09:06:17-08:00","id":1347042,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1346863-what-would-happen-if-a-solar-exalted-fell-in-love-with-an-abyssal?p=1347036#post1347036\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are the Sidereals the ones behind the Immaculate Order?</div> </div> </div> </div>At least in 3e, the Sidereals were involved in shaping the Immaculate Faith when it emerged during the Shogunate, and when the Immaculate Order was founded in the early days of the Scarlet Empress' reign, the Sidereals took a hand in organizing it, and still maintain influence, with a few Sidereals maintaining cover identities as Immaculate Monks. But they aren't the sole manipulators of the Immaculates - Dragon-Blooded are just as important, if not more, to the Order and the Faith as a whole. Dragon-Bloods contributed to the philosophical underpinnings of the Immaculates, founding the Order and building it into a pillar of Realm society was a collaborative effort between the Sidereals and the Scarlet Empress (who seems to have known about the existence and general nature of Sidereals - they weren't pulling any wool over her eyes!), and the upper leadership of the modern-day Order is all Dragon-Blooded, who absolutely have their own motivations and goals, which can conflict with Sidereal ones and not get removed or neutralized out of hand.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-08T14:57:21-08:00","id":1347107,"title":"","content":"Thank you! That\u2019s perfect. Chejop Kejak is the leader of the Bronze Faction, right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-08T16:00:27-08:00","id":1347118,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1346863-what-would-happen-if-a-solar-exalted-fell-in-love-with-an-abyssal?p=1347107#post1347107\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thank you! That\u2019s perfect. Chejop Kejak is the leader of the Bronze Faction, right?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That's correct, though exactly what being &quot;the leader&quot; entails is, again, something that's kind of varied between editions and hasn't been firmly pinned down in 3e yet. 2e had him be a more formal leader for the Bronze Faction, assigning Bronze Faction Sidereals to missions, giving them orders, that kind of thing. The approach I prefer personally, though, is to make the Factions within the Sidereals a bit more informal, with Chejop and other Bronze Faction higher-ups not having the legal authority to command younger Sidereals, but rather having to rely on more social pull and bureaucratic maneuvering to accomplish their private goals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-08T16:29:19-08:00","id":1347126,"title":"","content":"That sounds like what I would do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-08T22:03:50-08:00","id":1347167,"title":"","content":"Yep. Of course, our game is only one way an Abyssal/Solar relationship could go. I\u2019d say there are as many potential outcomes as there are types of relationships, with both partners having to deal with self-destructive urges of various types.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24172-sticks","name":"Sticks","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24172_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-09T17:55:37-08:00","id":1347355,"title":"","content":"Also, Sticks' Zenith did meet her Lunar mate. The Lunar startled most of the Tya crew, but in the end, they set up two betting pools. One, if the Abyssal and the Lunar would get in a fight over the Solar (The Captain, the Night caste, won that bet). The second bet was if anyone could convince the Lunar to take a bath.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Games I am currently playing in:<br /> <a href=\"http://www.giantitp.com/forums/showthread.php?594693-The-Convergence-of-Sky-An-Exalted-campaign\" target=\"_blank\">The Convergence of Sky (Exalted 3e)</a><br /> <a href=\"http://www.giantitp.com/forums/showthread.php?543906-The-Lotus-Blossoms!\" target=\"_blank\">The Lotus Blossoms! (Exalted 3e)</a><br /> <a href=\"http://www.giantitp.com/forums/showthread.php?584663-The-Lotus-Blossoms!-Volume-II\" target=\"_blank\">The Lotus Blossoms! Vol II (Exalted 3e)</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24467-malozing","name":"Malozing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24467_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-09T21:20:28-08:00","id":1347398,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24467-malozing\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24467_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24467\" data-vbnamecard=\"24467\">Malozing</a> \ud83d\ude02 most people can be convinced to take a bath before they hook up with the person they love...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-09T22:02:28-08:00","id":1347401,"title":"","content":"Oh, not much love there, perhaps possessiveness and some jealousy, but they literally just met and didn\u2019t hit it off well.<br /> <br /> My Zenith\u2019s lunar mate is a dyed-in-the-wool devotee of Ma-Ha-Suchi. Anti-civilization to the extreme, including no hygiene.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24172-sticks","name":"Sticks","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24172_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-09T22:04:24-08:00","id":1347402,"title":"","content":"I don\u2019t think Ma-Ha-Suchi would take it that far. Even animals clean themselves.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-09T22:28:50-08:00","id":1347407,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1346863-what-would-happen-if-a-solar-exalted-fell-in-love-with-an-abyssal?p=1347402#post1347402\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don\u2019t think Ma-Ha-Suchi would take it that far. Even animals clean themselves.</div> </div> </div> </div>Haha, yeah. It\u2019s one of those \u2018what the student hears isn\u2019t what the teacher teaches\u2019 situations, I think. This Lunar forgoes clothing, bathing, and if I remember correctly is suspicious of cooked food, all of this is apparently new since her Exaltation. <br /> <br /> We actually didn\u2019t spend long with her, she left after an in-game month on reasonably good terms, but it\u2019s hard to tell where that particular plot-thread will go. We left her somewhere near An-Teng and we\u2019ve since been to Chiaroscuro, Khirigast, the deep interior of Harborhead and now we\u2019re headed for Paragon and Dari of the Mists. <br /> <br /> Apparently one of our twilights\u2019 alter-egos made an impression on Cathak Drogath when he (took credit for) slaying an Abyssal in Chiaroscuro, now Drogath has been captured and reached out to our Twilight for help. Things are getting complicated fast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24172-sticks","name":"Sticks","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24172_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-21T13:16:23-08:00","id":1350094,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1346863-what-would-happen-if-a-solar-exalted-fell-in-love-with-an-abyssal?p=1347036#post1347036\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2402_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2402\" data-vbnamecard=\"2402\">The Wizard of Oz</a> too bad sexting doesn\u2019t exist in Exalted...</div> </div> </div> </div>Nonsense, you just pay a sorcerer to cast infallible messenger and relay your sexy message. You may have to pay for the sorcerer to be discreet about the service rendered though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3012-uknown-darklord","name":"Uknown DarkLord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3012_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-21T13:59:17-08:00","id":1350113,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3012-uknown-darklord\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3012_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3012\" data-vbnamecard=\"3012\">Uknown DarkLord</a> yeah, but sexting usually involves sending dozens of messages back and forth till you both finish. That could get pretty expensive, even if you\u2019re a Princess of the Earth. Unless of course you are a sorceress...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-21T18:12:07-08:00","id":1350159,"title":"","content":"Custom sexting artifacts might work...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24172-sticks","name":"Sticks","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24172_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-21T20:35:15-08:00","id":1350176,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sticks</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1346863-what-would-happen-if-a-solar-exalted-fell-in-love-with-an-abyssal?p=1350159#post1350159\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Custom sexting artifacts might work...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Magical paper, when you write or draw something in it, it appears in a linked piece which was created along it (which is the one your husbando is carrying), and viceversa, so pretty much instant written communication between two persons. It could be used to pass secret information, but... Well, you know.<br /> <br /> Sexting. Which is usually secret, or at least private!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13031-clophiroth","name":"Clophiroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13031_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-21T21:18:28-08:00","id":1350180,"title":"","content":"Methinks 8 1/2 x 11 is excessive size for most.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24172-sticks","name":"Sticks","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24172_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-21T22:54:29-08:00","id":1350192,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sticks</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1346863-what-would-happen-if-a-solar-exalted-fell-in-love-with-an-abyssal?p=1350180#post1350180\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Methinks 8 1/2 x 11 is excessive size for most.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Of course it is. But this allows you to have extended conversations.<br /> <br /> Extended sexting conversations. With drawings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13031-clophiroth","name":"Clophiroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13031_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-22T11:08:48-08:00","id":1350264,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13031-clophiroth\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar13031_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"13031\" data-vbnamecard=\"13031\">Clophiroth</a> I love it! That way if the person you have feelings for is an Immaculate monk, you can still get sexual with them without making them violate their oath of celibacy. Or if you were away adventuring and your husband (or boyfriend or whatever) was back on their estate or stuck at court in the Imperial City.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-22T11:53:16-08:00","id":1350276,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1346863-what-would-happen-if-a-solar-exalted-fell-in-love-with-an-abyssal?p=1350264#post1350264\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13031-clophiroth\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar13031_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"13031\" data-vbnamecard=\"13031\">Clophiroth</a> I love it! That way if the person you have feelings for is an Immaculate monk, you can still get sexual with them without making them violate their oath of celibacy. Or if you were away adventuring and your husband (or boyfriend or whatever) was back on their estate or stuck at court in the Imperial City.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I\u00b4m glad you like it <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13031-clophiroth","name":"Clophiroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13031_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-22T20:32:36-08:00","id":1350378,"title":"","content":"<span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> I am curious what prompted this thread in the first place. I\u2019ve been enjoying this thread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24172-sticks","name":"Sticks","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24172_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-22T21:35:10-08:00","id":1350382,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Clophiroth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1346863-what-would-happen-if-a-solar-exalted-fell-in-love-with-an-abyssal?p=1350176#post1350176\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Magical paper, when you write or draw something in it, it appears in a linked piece which was created along it (which is the one your husbando is carrying), and viceversa, so pretty much instant written communication between two persons. It could be used to pass secret information, but... Well, you know.<br /> <br /> Sexting. Which is usually secret, or at least private!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Immensely relatable because my last dynast character had a book of this kind that he was suppossed to use to pass reports from lands visited and a lot of other stuff from the circle's war campaign in a rebel satrapy in the Southeast back to his patrons and allies in the Heptagram and a number of sorcerous, occultist and crafter societies.<br /> <br /> But all too regularly would use to &quot;maintain fresh contact&quot; with his fiancee in the Blessed Isle. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-23T05:31:32-08:00","id":1350425,"title":"","content":"I've had more in-character relationships with Abyssals than is probably healthy. Not with my Solars because there was already someone making risky/unfortunate romance choices in those games that I kind of stepped back to watch sparks fly.<br /> <br /> My own game has had quite a bit of Solar and Abyssal relationships though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-23T06:38:47-08:00","id":1350431,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24172-sticks\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24172_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24172\" data-vbnamecard=\"24172\">Sticks</a> thanks. I just thought it would make a great romance storyline.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]}]}